                    "id": "639010101",
                    "speaker": "（test）Override成女$UNRELEASED",
                    "text": "（test）真没想到居然会在蒙德境内看到这样的景色…$UNRELEASED"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6390102",
            "initDialog": "639010201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "639010201",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "（test）你在嘀咕什么？"
                },
                {
                    "id": "639010202",
                    "speaker": "（test）Override成女$UNRELEASED",
                    "text": "（test）我是一位研究环境与地理的学者，正在调查雪山的地形。$UNRELEASED"
                },
                {
                    "id": "639010203",
                    "speaker": "（test）Override成女$UNRELEASED",
                    "text": "（test）蒙德这样的气候竟然会有雪山出现，真是太不可思议了。$UNRELEASED"
                },
                {
                    "id": "639010204",
                    "speaker": "（test）Override成女$UNRELEASED",
                    "text": "（test）以前我游历其他地方也看到过类似的情况，例如璃月境内的层岩巨渊等，这些地形或许存在某些共通性…$UNRELEASED"
                },
                {
                    "id": "639010205",
                    "speaker": "（test）Override成女$UNRELEASED",
                    "text": "（test）我本来想到山上好好研究研究的，结果被那位西风骑士拦下来了，真扫兴。$UNRELEASED"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6390103",
            "initDialog": "639010301",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "639010301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "（test）再见。"
                },
                {
                    "id": "639010302",
                    "speaker": "（test）Override成女$UNRELEASED",
                    "text": "（test）嗯，路上小心。$UNRELEASED"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}